<p>Once verification is complete, the uncrating process commences with a focus on testing electrical and mechanical items. All powered equipment must be plugged into a grounded outlet and powered on to confirm functionality. Operators should run basic diagnostic checks to ensure motors spin freely, fans rotate correctly, and digital displays initialize without error.</p>
