<p>Simultaneously, clean furniture placement is executed according to the pre-approved floor plan. Items are moved directly to their designated locations, avoiding unnecessary back-and-forth movement that could cause scuffs or drops. Care is taken to protect flooring and walls during the maneuvering of heavy pieces. As each box is opened, the packaging materials are systematically collected.</p>
